{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15556","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 沈回","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今来游上苑，春染柳条轻。\n濯濯方含色，依依若有情。\n分行临曲沼，先发媚重城。\n拂水枝偏弱，摇风丝已生。\n变黄随淑景，吐翠逐新晴。\n伫立徒延首，裴回欲寄诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈回","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15556.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15556","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}